,"cache_write_tokens":0.0,"input_tokens":116757.0,"llm_calls":1,"output_tokens":2705.0,"requests":7}}}},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Specify the G1 exclusion predicate precisely: exclude an old event ONLY when a PRIOR SNAPSHOT is present in the fold set, the event's timestamp precedes that snapshot, AND its uuid is absent from that snapshot's source_event_uuids — so the first-fold / no-prior-snapshot case cites and retires normally.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.2044,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'the natural fold (compact_txn) must EXCLUDE un-cited pre-snapshot events from both retirement and source_event_uuids citation'","compact_txn.py _parse_candidate_events (lines 201-220) enumerates ALL active .json; source_uuids at 551-555 cites every non-SNAPSHOT old event; nothing today reads a prior snapshot's source_event_uuids inside the fold","'pre-snapshot' and 'cited' are only well-defined relative to a folded-in PRIOR SNAPSHOT's source_event_uuids; on a ticket's first-ever compaction there is no prior snapshot, so a literal reading of 'un-cited' selects every event"],"finding":"The G1 exclusion predicate ('exclude un-cited pre-snapshot events') is undefined for the first-fold / no-prior-snapshot case, where every event is trivially 'un-cited' and could be wrongly excluded from citation and retirement.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fb303ded3d70d0f1f","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Proposed fix #1 / Scope: src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py","norm_id":"n427b045e297c0e24","priority":0.5956,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A ticket crossing the compaction threshold for the FIRST time (no prior SNAPSHOT in the fold set) — an over-broad predicate would exclude all events from citation+retirement, producing an empty/degenerate snapshot and leaving every source live"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"State in Proposed fix #1 that the defer guard reads the folded-in prior snapshot(s)' source_event_uuids and spares an old event only if (prior snapshot exists) AND (event ts < that snapshot ts) AND (uuid not in its cited set); absent a prior snapshot, all old events fold as today.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Scope the G4 routing parity to the ORPHAN_EVENT rebuild trigger ONLY: order-sensitive (_HUMAN_TRIAGE) orphans stop triggering a rebuild, while SNAPSHOT_STALE_CHANNEL / SNAPSHOT_MISSING_SOURCES / SNAPSHOT_INCONSISTENT rebuild paths in repair_or_plan remain unchanged.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.2789,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: '--repair-snapshots applies the same _AUTO_RECOVER/_HUMAN_TRIAGE routing instead of rebuilding unconditionally'","fsck_repair.py:574-580: repair_or_plan's `rebuildable` triggers on SNAPSHOT_INCONSISTENT OR ORPHAN_EVENT OR SNAPSHOT_STALE_CHANNEL OR SNAPSHOT_MISSING_SOURCES","_AUTO_RECOVER_ORPHAN_TYPES / _HUMAN_TRIAGE